## note: every canonical prefix of the type word resolves, plus command
## note: abbreviations and the unique-prefix vs ambiguous boundary.

enable
conf t
interface g0/0
interface gi0/0
interface gig0/0
interface giga0/0
interface gigab0/0
interface gigabi0/0
interface gigabit0/0
interface gigabite0/0
interface gigabitet0/0
